    ],
    "figures": [],
    "analysis": "Budget sweep 回答 reviewer Q4 (\"How does this work at different compression ratios?\")。 关键 insight: moderate compression 是 practical sweet spot，aggressive compression 展示 constraint 的 catastrophic prevention 价值。\n\n\nCompression 越激进，non-uniform allocation 的价值越大。2× 时 budget 充裕，大部分 heads 留在 4-bit， 差异小。4× 是 paper 主战场，MCKP +29.4% 是 headline。8× 时 uniform 只能全 2-bit (PPL 2644 catastrophic)， 而 MCKP 通过 cardinality constraint 保护关键 heads 在 4-bit，PPL 57.6——仍然高但 45× better。 best 档下 reviewer 接受 \"compression amplifies benefit\" 作为 deployment motivation。\n"
  },
  {
    "name": "High-resolution profiling",
    "description": "64 seq × 2048 tokens hires profiling (vs 16×512 lowres)。验证 profiling quality 影响 allocation quality。\n",
    "results": {
      "hires_mckp_ppl": 10.91,
      "lowres_mckp_ppl": 11.23,
      "improvement_ppl": 0.32,
      "improvement_pct": "2.9%",
      "hires_nonzero_2bit_heads": 100,
      "lowres_nonzero_2bit_heads": 37,
      "profiling_time_min": 65.5,
      "allocation_diff_count": 8,
      "bit_distribution": {
        "2": 8,
        "4": 100,
        "8": 4
      }
    },
    "tables": [
      {
        "name": "Profiling Resolution Comparison",
        "rows": [
          {
            "resolution": "16×512 (lowres)",
            "mckp_ppl": 11.23,
            "nonzero_heads": 37,
            "time_min": "~10"
          },
          {
            "resolution": "64×2048 (hires)",
            "mckp_ppl": 10.91,
            "nonzero_heads": 100,
            "time_min": 65.5
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "figures": [],
    "analysis": "hires profiling 是论文 §5.4 的 ablation。关键区别：lowres 下 solver 只能区分 37 heads， hires 下能区分 100 heads。但两者 bit distribution 完全相同 (2:8, 4:100, 8:4)——constraint 的稳定性 进一步证明它是 robust intervention。\n\n\nhires profiling 将 non-zero 2-bit delta 的 head 数从 37 增到 100/112，给 solver 更多信号区分 heads。 PPL 从 11.23 降到 10.91 (gap recovery 从 ~75% 升到 ~81%)。8 个 head 的分配发生变化。 best 档下，reviewer 认可 profiling resolution 是一个 practical hyperparameter，65 min 的开销对 offline profiling 可接受。这强化了 \"profiling data quality matters\" 的叙事，但 constraint 仍然是 primary intervention——hires 只是 marginal improvement on top of constraint。\n"
  },
  {
    "name": "C4 cross-dataset evaluation",
    "description": "在 C4 上 calibrate 和 evaluate，验证结果不依赖 WikiText-2。包含 cross-domain transfer。\n",
    "results": {
      "c4_cal_wt2_eval_mckp_ppl": 11.29,
      "c4_cal_wt2_eval_uniform_ppl": 15.45,
