            "mckp_ppl": 11.29,
            "uniform_ppl": 15.45
          },
          {
            "calibration": "WikiText-2",
            "eval": "C4",
            "mckp_ppl": 20.56,
            "uniform_ppl": 35.42
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "figures": [],
    "analysis": "C4 实验回答 \"WikiText-2 specific?\" 质疑。96.4% agreement 是 strong evidence。 cross-domain transfer 性能比同 domain 差但 MCKP 优势保持。\n\n\n96.4% allocation agreement (108/112 heads) 证明 profiling-based allocation 对 calibration data 的 choice 鲁棒。 4 个不一致 heads 的 delta 差异小，对最终 PPL 影响仅 0.034。cross-domain transfer (wt2→c4) 同样 MCKP >> uniform (20.56 vs 35.42)。best 档下 reviewer 接受 \"calibration-robust\" 的 claim， 不要求额外 calibration domain 实验。WikiText-2 contamination 不是 concern。\n"
  },
  {
    "name": "RateQuant greedy comparison",
    "description": "实现 RateQuant Algorithm 1 greedy 在 {2,4,8,16} 上。证明 polymatroid optimality 在非连续 bit-width 上 breaks。\n",
    "results": {
      "greedy_unconstrained_ppl": 32.45,
      "mckp_unconstrained_ppl": 36.92,
      "uniform_4bit_ppl": 15.45,
      "greedy_2bit_count": 68,
      "greedy_bit_dist": {
        "2": 68,
        "4": 30,
        "8": 4,
        "16": 10
      }
    },
    "tables": [
      {
        "name": "RateQuant vs MCKP on {2,4,8,16}",
        "rows": [
          {
            "method": "RateQuant greedy (unconstrained)",
            "ppl": 32.45,
            "2bit_heads": 68
          },
